{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q家具や生活雑貨もそろってきた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aハイ！だいぶ(笑)順調"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q料理してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aうーん！って感じ(笑)でも作れるよ(ドヤッ)本とか見たら(笑)見ずに作れるのもあるもん(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまぁやんの好きなアイスは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aえ〜全部すき......wwあはっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q他の絵文字も表現出来るかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aわかんない(笑)今度聞いてみる(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまぁやは花粉症大丈夫？\nAイエス！チャ〜ラ〜ヘッチャラ〜w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q寒さを感じない若さ俺にも分けてくれない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aえ〜？しょうがないなぁ(笑)わかさ〜まぁやパーンッチッ！\nどうだっ！ドヤッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qサッカー場でのライブは楽しめた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aハイ！やばいね\n自分がサッカーの試合を見に行っていたあのステージで踊れるとは思ってもなくて！最高でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qサッカー場の芝はどうだった？ふわふわだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aイエス×３"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qこの写真......なんかロッティに似てない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aえっ？まあやの隣はロッティよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまた香川に来てくれるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A行きたいよ〜今度行かせて〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qイベント会場やシアターでの響きとはぜんぜんちゃうでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aちがうね(笑)いい経験できたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q乃木坂の色の垂れ幕メインスタンドで広げてましたが気づいてもらえましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aあったりまえです！嬉しくて仕方ありませんでした！私たちの為にそんなことまでしていただいて！   本当に感謝です♪ありがとです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q心細く、不安を感じているのではないか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A垂れ幕みて私は安心して、ステージにでれました！その心使いありがとう御座います☆本当に私は幸せ者です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q今後ビックアーチでライブする機会はあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aまだわからないです！でもやりたいです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q体調は崩してませんか？\nA大丈夫です！ありがとう御座います！\n皆様は大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qサンフレッチェの主要な選手の顔と名前や、チームがどのくらいの順位なのかは把握してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A はい！だいたいは！\n今度試合見に行きたいですっ(笑)あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやマッチョすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aあぁマッチョも好きですよ(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁやは気づいた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵文字を沢山使うと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字数がすぐに無くなるということ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから質問返しは頑張って使わなかったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだ答えれてないのがあるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度に期待して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとハンバーガー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たべに行ったの！\n私の椅子の横に..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいてあった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこにすわっちった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか昨日はヤバかったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被害にあいましたよぉ\n家に帰りたくても電車がとまるし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話で場所を伝えるにも雨で前が見えなくて伝えれないし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傘はさした瞬間ボロボロ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二本も..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソックスはビチャビチャ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ凄すぎて笑いしか出なかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様は大丈夫だった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか私の携帯に...\n私がマスクで顔を全部隠して寝てたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その写真が私の携帯にあって......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が私の携帯で私の顔を撮ったのか未だわかりません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂事件ですよこれは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらいいかなぁ？wwww\n皆様"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に犯人を見つけて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/1608030/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}